					"content": "I see Degui over there. Let's observe for a minute, shall we?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360602,
					"content": "Have you ever met Degui? I know him best by the drinks he sells in his shop...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360603,
					"content": "I've actually already thought about what I would write for him. Here, have a listen:",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360604,
					"content": "\"Third-Round Knockout is what people say\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360605,
						413360606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360605,
					"content": "Okay...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360607
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413360607,
					"content": "\"But just three bowls will leave you in dismay\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360608,
					"content": "Hmm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360609,
					"content": "So far so good...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413360610,
					"content": "The title is... \"All in All, a Good Guy\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360611,
						413360612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360611,
					"content": "W—Wait a second!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413360613,
					"content": "No good? Well, I did come up with another line, but I'm not sure how to continue it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360614,
					"content": "Perhaps you'd like to give it a go?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360615,
					"content": "The first line I've come up with is \"An indulgent bowl of rich rice wine\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360616,
					"content": "How about, \"Topped with pearly white dumplings so fine.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360617
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413360617,
					"content": "Oh, that's quite good. How about the title?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360618,
					"content": "\"Extravagant but Elegant.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413360619,
					"content": "\"An indulgent bowl of rich rice wine, topped with pearly white dumplings so fine\"... \"Extravagant but Elegant\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360620,
					"content": "Not bad, not bad at all. You certainly have a talent for writing. Let me write this all on the lantern now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360621,
					"content": "There! Now we're ready to give the lantern to Degui.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Linling"
				},
				{
					"id": 413360612,
					"content": "That's no good at all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413360606,
					"content": "Sounds good so far...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413360607
					]
				}
			]
		},
